span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 14 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  14  gp</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-4a15129b8c8b6444END_WIDGET ￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-9de8b321f16d8e4aEND_WIDGET\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">BOOK_GLO_Alchemy_DrowPoison</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_GLO_Alchemy_DrowPoison\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_GLO_Alchemy_DrowPoison\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">c7308ec2-66ea-4daa-a426-8da27eaa09a4</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:c7308ec2-66ea-4daa-a426-8da27eaa09a4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:c7308ec2-66ea-4daa-a426-8da27eaa09a4\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>On a bookshelf in <a href=\"/wiki/Moonrise_Towers#Balthazar's_room\" title=\"Moonrise Towers\">Balthazar's Chambers</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-150&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-169</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>[This entry from the master of Alchemy, Haskinn Xhesilaphin, begins with the formula for Drow Poison:]\n</p><p><br>\nCombine Essence of Swarming Toadstool with any Salts, and lo, you'll have yourself a dose of <a href=\"/wiki/Drow_Poison\" title=\"Drow Poison\">Drow Poison</a> as dark as the Goddess <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lolth\" title=\"Lolth\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/01/Lolth_Icon.webp/15px-Lolth_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/01/Lolth_Icon.webp/23px-Lolth_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/01/Lolth_Icon.webp/31px-Lolth_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Lolth's\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/01/Lolth_Icon.webp/15px-Lolth_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"15\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/01/Lolth_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Lolth\" title=\"Lolth\">Lolth's</a> temper.\n</p><p><br>\nTime was I would grimace at the prospect of poison. Not that I think it's cowardly. I just didn't think that was my legacy: the scaleless dragonborn who wrote some books that jilted scum used to poison their heartbreakers. My old friend Nikros tried to convince me that such poison better equip adventurers for danger of the road. What a crude, happy-go-fuck-reality attitude. Adventurers make up a sliver of the Sword Coast's populance. Mostly it's folk trying to get by, and in this day and age that means poisoning your ex-lover, or some man who stole your prize goat, or some woman who called you a crabby little bitch behind your back.\n</p><p>Well, I say go ahead.\n</p><p>Use my work however you want.\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715113113\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.053 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.055 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1835/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 35642/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 11375/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.011/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 932043/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   43.575      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   43.575      1 -total\n 56.42%   24.585      8 Template:Icon_text\n 50.07%   21.816     19 Template:Trim\n 22.19%    9.670      2 Template:Uid\n 15.65%    6.818      3 Template:Icon_link\n 14.15%    6.164      1 Template:Main_only\n 13.21%    5.755      2 Template:Template_style\n  9.96%    4.340      8 Template:Ifempty\n  9.60%    4.184      1 Template:Books\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:32274-0!canonical and timestamp 20260715113113 and revision id 330474. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}